  "notes": "Jefferson County Republican committee seats were last on the ballot in the April 23, 2024 primary as 'Republican Committeeperson (4 Yr) - <precinct>', vote for 2 per precinct; the May 19, 2026 primary results contain no Republican county committee contests. A seat is 'filled' when a printed ballot candidate received votes, 'empty' when no candidate ran and no write-in votes were cast, and 'unknown' when write-in votes were cast, since the report does not show whether a write-in winner qualified or accepted. The 2024 report has 37 precincts; by 2026 the county reported 38 precincts and renamed Brookville and Punxsutawney districts (e.g. 'Brookville Borough 1') and added a 'Falls Creek Borough 2', so these 2024 names may not match current precinct names. Appointments or vacancies since 2024 are not reflected."
